      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That feeling of lingering, of being stuck on a set long after the show ended, is incredibly isolating. If the old script no longer fits, maybe the pressure to \"be productive\" is just another performance you don't need to give. It might be time to stop trying to act and instead just allow yourself to be exactly where you are, even if that place is quiet and dark.",
      "source": "target",
